usage: okf.py links <bundle-dir> [--dangling]

Unresolved targets in three groups: broken body links (tolerated, §6.1),
path-valued fields pointing nowhere inside the bundle, and path-valued
fields that escape the bundle root and find no file (provenance
breakage). Exit 1 only for the external group.

options:
  --dangling           group unresolved internal targets by directory with the files that reference them
